1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Good morning, good morning,

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Hello sunshine, hello day!

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
उठ जाओ वेद प्यारे,

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Come on out and smile and play!

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Stretch your arms up to the sky,

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Wiggle fingers, blink your eyes.

7
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,000
सूरज आया, रोशनी लाई,

8
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:41,000
नई सुबह खुशियाँ लाई!

9
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Clap, clap, clap your hands,

10
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Turn around and dance, dance, dance!

11
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:07,000
हँसो ज़रा और ताली बजाओ,

12
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:11,000
वेद के संग सब मुस्कुराओ!

13
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,000
Wash your face and brush, brush, brush,

14
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Take your time, there's no need to rush.

15
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:37,000
मुँह धो लो और दाँत चमकाओ,

16
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:41,000
साफ़-सुथरे बनकर आओ!

17
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:29,000
Good morning, good morning, what a lovely day,

18
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:33,000
Learn and laugh and sing and play!

19
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:37,000
वेद बोले, आओ भाई,

20
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:41,000
हर सुबह है नई मिठाई!

21
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:10,000
Wave goodbye and smile today!

22
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:15,000
See you soon — come back and play!
